{
  "id": "c1-e19-leadership",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Leadership",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you consider yourself a natural leader?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, who has been the best leader you have worked with or been taught by?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what qualities do you think a good leader needs?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever had to take charge in a difficult situation?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e19-a1",
            "c1-e19-a2",
            "c1-e19-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people in leadership roles. Choose two of the pictures and say what challenges these leaders might face, and how the people they lead might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these leadership roles would you find the most demanding?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e19-b1",
            "c1-e19-b2",
            "c1-e19-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show different kinds of leaders. Choose two of the pictures and say what skills these leaders might need, and how they might gain people's trust.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think leaders are born or made?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some qualities that people value in leaders, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e19-leadership",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How important are these qualities for a leader to be effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e19-leadership",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most essential?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about leadership.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it possible to be a good leader and still be liked by everyone?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should leaders accept responsibility when things go wrong?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think the best leaders are those with the most experience?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How has the idea of leadership changed in the age of social media?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should schools teach leadership skills?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, can a group work well without a leader?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e19-leadership/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
